            "target_entity_instance": "Southern Hemisphere",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "The integration of the Southern Annular Mode (SAM), a key driver of extratropical climate variability in the Southern Hemisphere (Fogt and Marshall, 2020), further allows us to examine how regional atmospheric circulation patterns influence local dune dynamics.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
